• Move dumbbells near your body with slightly bent arms towards your back', 'costas', '["dorsais"]', '["glúteos"]', '["Halteres"]', NULL, 'CC-BY-SA 4', 'M9', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/1434/view/', 'lat pull db dorsais gluteos halteres', '2026-09-10T15:18:12.614Z');
INSERT INTO exercises (id, wger_id, language, name, description, category, muscles, muscles_secondary, equipment, image_url, license, license_author, source_url, search_blob, updated_at) VALUES ('8c496646-baa8-4ed3-97b1-702e213fdeca', 354, 'en', 'Lat Pull Down (Leaning Back)', 'Lean Back, Pull into chest', 'costas', '["dorsais"]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 'CC-BY-SA 3', 'drthurlow', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/354/view/', 'lat pull down (leaning back) dorsais', '2026-09-10T15:18:12.614Z');
INSERT INTO exercises (id, wger_id, language, name, description, category, muscles, muscles_secondary, equipment, image_url, license, license_author, source_url, search_blob, updated_at) VALUES ('5a096571-4eae-472e-8849-fe5647035e2c', 1659, 'en', 'Lat Pulldown - Cross Body Single Arm', 'Sit at lat pulldown machine with body at a diagonal angle so that only one leg is under the pad. Pull the cable down with the opposite arm. this will force the cable to across your body while pulling down. Emphasises the stretch of the lat.', 'costas', '["dorsais"]', '[]', '["Máquina de cabo"]', NULL, 'CC-BY-SA 4', 'Shiladree', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/1659/view/', 'lat pulldown - cross body single arm dorsais maquina de cabo', '2026-09-10T15:18:12.614Z');
INSERT INTO exercises (id, wger_id, language, name, description, category, muscles, muscles_secondary, equipment, image_url, license, license_author, source_url, search_blob, updated_at) VALUES ('b6054509-576f-429c-960f-73c84f481b7c', 2540, 'en', 'Lat Pulldown Isometric', 'An isometric Lat pulldown is a strength-building exercise where you pull the bar down to your chest and hold the contracted position at the bottom without moving your limbs for a set number of seconds', 'costas', '["dorsais"]', '[]', '["Máquina de cabo"]', NULL, 'CC-BY-SA 4', 'HexoctusEngineering', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/2540/view/', 'lat pulldown isometric dorsais maquina de cabo', '2026-09-10T15:18:12.614Z');
INSERT INTO exercises (id, wger_id, language, name, description, category, muscles, muscles_secondary, equipment, image_url, license, license_author, source_url, search_blob, updated_at) VALUES ('45e44940-d4a0-4c66-8cbb-7afe785d5610', 1325, 'en', 'Lateral Push Off', 'Push off the ground and land on one leg and regain balance before jumping to the other leg', 'pernas', '["panturrilhas"]', '["posteriores de coxa"]', '["Peso corporal"]', 'https://wger.de/media/exercise-images/1325/d8372291-6725-452a-9711-6321c061e354.jpg', 'CC-BY-SA 4', 'cleen', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/1325/view/', 'lateral push off panturrilhas posteriores de coxa peso corporal', '2026-09-10T15:18:12.614Z');
INSERT INTO exercises (id, wger_id, language, name, description, category, muscles, muscles_secondary, equipment, image_url, license, license_author, source_url, search_blob, updated_at) VALUES ('2d580008-4918-430a-b0bd-4fcfe8783195', 2538, 'en', 'Lateral Raise Isometric', 'An isometric lateral raise is a shoulder exercise where you hold your arms out to the sides at waist height for a set amount of time instead of moving up and down', 'ombros', '["ombros"]', '[]', '["Máquina de cabo"]', NULL, 'CC-BY-SA 4', 'HexoctusEngineering', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/2538/view/', 'lateral raise isometric ombros maquina de cabo', '2026-09-10T15:18:12.614Z');
INSERT INTO exercises (id, wger_id, language, name, description, category, muscles, muscles_secondary, equipment, image_url, license, license_author, source_url, search_blob, updated_at) VALUES ('63375f5b-2d81-471c-bea4-fc3d207e96cb', 348, 'en', 'Lateral Raises', 'This exercise works the deltoid muscle of the shoulder. The movement starts with the arms straight, and the hands holding weights at the sides or in front of the body. Body is in a slight forward-leaning position with hips and knees bent a little. Arms are kept straight or slightly bent, and raised through an arc of movement in the coronal plane that terminates when the hands are at approximately shoulder height. Weights are lowered to the starting position, completing one rep. When using a cable machine the individual stands with the coronal plane in line with the pulley, which is at or near the ground.[9] The exercise can be completed one shoulder at a time (with the other hand used to stabilize the body against the weight moved), or with both hands simultaneously if two parallel pulleys are available.', 'ombros', '["ombros"]', '[]', '["Halteres"]', 'https://wger.de/media/exercise-images/148/lateral-dumbbell-raises-large-2.png', 'CC-BY-SA 3', 'wger.de', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/348/view/', 'lateral raises ombros halteres', '2026-09-10T15:18:12.614Z');
INSERT INTO exercises (id, wger_id, language, name, description, category, muscles, muscles_secondary, equipment, image_url, license, license_author, source_url, search_blob, updated_at) VALUES ('57263316-6f34-4539-952b-b07e09bac3ba', 349, 'en', 'Lateral Rows on Cable, One Armed', 'Set cable at waist height, start with arm across your belly and move han over and out too other side, one arm at the time.', 'ombros', '["ombros"]', '[]', '["Máquina de cabo"]', 'https://wger.de/media/exercise-images/349/9d969203-9cb6-4d47-9c31-fef53bfe1de5.png', 'CC-BY-SA 3', 'wger.de', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/349/view/', 'lateral rows on cable, one armed ombros maquina de cabo', '2026-09-10T15:18:12.614Z');
INSERT INTO exercises (id, wger_id, language, name, description, category, muscles, muscles_secondary, equipment, image_url, license, license_author, source_url, search_blob, updated_at) VALUES ('c5015ed9-042b-42d3-9dac-13759ea9571e', 1514, 'en', 'Lateral Walk', 'Lateral walks, also known as side steps or squat walks, are a type of exercise where you move sideways in a squatting position. They can be performed with or without resistance bands. These exercises strengthen the hip abductors, glutes, and other stabilizing muscles.', 'costas', '["glúteos"]', '[]', '["Peso corporal"]', NULL, 'CC-BY-SA 4', 'cozyGalvinism', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/1514/view/', 'lateral walk gluteos peso corporal', '2026-09-10T15:18:12.614Z');
INSERT INTO exercises (id, wger_id, language, name, description, category, muscles, muscles_secondary, equipment, image_url, license, license_author, source_url, search_blob, updated_at) VALUES ('dac3c714-f0c6-4d97-8283-17be7dd77b65', 351, 'en', 'Lateral-to-Front Raises', '-(1) Perform a lateral raise, pausing at the top of the lift (2).

 -Instead of lowering the weight, bring it to the front of your body so that you appear to be at the top position of a front raise. You will do this by using a Pec Fly motion, maintaining straight arms. (3)

 -Now lower the weight to your quadriceps, or, in other words, lower the dumbbells as though you are completing a Front Raise repetition. (4)

 -Reverse the motion: Perform a front raise (5), at the apex of the lift use a Reverse Fly motion to position the weights at the top of a Lateral Raise (6), and finally, lower the weights until your palms are essentially touching the sides of your thighs (7). THIS IS ONE REP.

 (1) l front view (2) -l- FV (3) l- side view (4) l SV/FV (5) l- SV (6) -l- FV (7) l FV/SV', 'ombros', '["ombros","trapézio"]', '[]', '["Halteres"]', NULL, 'CC-BY-SA 4', 'nate303303', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/351/view/', 'lateral-to-front raises ombros trapezio halteres', '2026-09-10T15:18:12.614Z');
INSERT INTO exercises (id, wger_id, language, name, description, category, muscles, muscles_secondary, equipment, image_url, license, license_author, source_url, search_blob, updated_at) VALUES ('7f8997d2-e21f-492f-a470-b9f0c5e54f1d', 1013, 'en', 'Left levator scapulae stretch', 'Starting position:

 Start standing up or sitting down. Turn your head to the left, around 45 degrees or just above your nipple. Place your right hand behind your back or sit on it. Take your left hand and use it to hold the back of your head. Lean your head down slightly.

 Steps:

 

• After assuming the starting position, press your head against your left hand with slight force. Your hand should press back with equal force, so that your head doesn''t move. Hold this position.', 'costas', '["costas"]', '[]', '["Peso corporal"]', NULL, 'CC-BY-SA 4', '', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/1013/view/', 'left levator scapulae stretch costas peso corporal', '2026-09-10T15:18:12.614Z');
INSERT INTO exercises (id, wger_id, language, name, description, category, muscles, muscles_secondary, equipment, image_url, license, license_author, source_url, search_blob, updated_at) VALUES ('505d6a28-1e24-4349-ab2b-49af3300e08e', 1589, 'en', 'Leg and hip stretch', 'Gentle movements to improve the flexibility of the lower body and release tension in the hips.', 'pernas', '["posteriores de coxa","glúteos","quadríceps"]', '["dorsais"]', '["Peso corporal"]', NULL, 'CC-BY-SA 4', 'MrAlfaRobot', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/1589/view/', 'leg and hip stretch posteriores de coxa gluteos quadriceps dorsais peso corporal', '2026-09-10T15:18:12.614Z');
INSERT INTO exercises (id, wger_id, language, name, description, category, muscles, muscles_secondary, equipment, image_url, license, license_author, source_url, search_blob, updated_at) VALUES ('48836f44-efcd-4471-a456-5f024936025a', 364, 'en', 'Leg Curl', 'The leg curl, also known as the hamstring curl, is an isolation exercise that targets the hamstring muscles. The exercise involves flexing the lower leg against resistance towards the buttocks. Other exercises that can be used to strengthen the hamstrings are the glute-ham raise and the deadlift.', 'pernas', '["posteriores de coxa","glúteos"]', '[]', '[]', 'https://wger.de/media/exercise-images/364/b318dde9-f5f2-489f-940a-cd864affb9e3.png', 'CC0', 'BFad07', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/364/view/', 'leg curl posteriores de coxa gluteos', '2026-09-10T15:18:12.614Z');
INSERT INTO exercises (id, wger_id, language, name, description, category, muscles, muscles_secondary, equipment, image_url, license, license_author, source_url, search_blob, updated_at) VALUES ('ca514fad-c6ce-47b0-93a0-dc73a3507099', 1603, 'en', 'Leg curl with elastic', 'Standing position: Place the band under your feet in the middle of your foot and grasp it with a hammer grip.', 'panturrilhas', '["panturrilhas"]', '["posteriores de coxa"]', '["Elástico"]', NULL, 'CC-BY-SA 4', 'clafal', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/1603/view/', 'leg curl with elastic panturrilhas posteriores de coxa elastico', '2026-09-10T15:18:12.614Z');
INSERT INTO exercises (id, wger_id, language, name, description, category, muscles, muscles_secondary, equipment, image_url, license, license_author, source_url, search_blob, updated_at) VALUES ('3bc8b411-a28d-4e1c-a6d1-769e18fe9881', 365, 'en', 'Leg Curls (laying)', 'Lay on a bench and put your calves behind the leg holder (better if they are hold on around the lower calves). Hold a grip on the bars to make sure the body is firmly in place. Bend your legs bringing the weight up, go slowly back. During the exercise the body should not move, all work is done by the legs.', 'pernas', '["posteriores de coxa"]', '[]', '[]', 'https://wger.de/media/exercise-images/154/lying-leg-curl-machine-large-1.png', 'CC-BY-SA 3', 'wger.de', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/365/view/', 'leg curls (laying) posteriores de coxa', '2026-09-10T15:18:12.614Z');
INSERT INTO exercises (id, wger_id, language, name, description, category, muscles, muscles_secondary, equipment, image_url, license, license_author, source_url, search_blob, updated_at) VALUES ('62170477-90ec-463c-907e-9e523abc0a15', 369, 'en', 'Leg Extension', 'The leg extension is a resistance weight training exercise that targets the quadriceps muscle in the legs. The exercise is done using a machine called the Leg Extension Machine. There are various manufacturers of these machines and each one is slightly different. Most gym and weight rooms will have the machine in their facility. The leg extension is an isolated exercise targeting one specific muscle group, the quadriceps. It should not be considered as a total leg workout, such as the squat or deadlift. The exercise consists of bending the leg at the knee and extending the legs, then lowering them back to the original position.', 'pernas', '["quadríceps"]', '[]', '[]', 'https://wger.de/media/exercise-images/369/78c915d1-e46d-4d30-8124-65d68664c3ef.png', 'CC0', 'BFad07', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/369/view/', 'leg extension quadriceps', '2026-09-10T15:18:12.614Z');
INSERT INTO exercises (id, wger_id, language, name, description, category, muscles, muscles_secondary, equipment, image_url, license, license_author, source_url, search_blob, updated_at) VALUES ('88c4d3e5-3837-4c71-bb06-c45e147496cc', 2535, 'en', 'Leg Extension Isometric', 'An isometric leg extension is a strengthening exercise where you contract your quadriceps muscles against an immovable resistance without changing the length of the muscle or moving your knee joint.', 'pernas', '["quadríceps"]', '[]', '["Máquina de cabo"]', NULL, 'CC-BY-SA 4', 'HexoctusEngineering', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/2535/view/', 'leg extension isometric quadriceps maquina de cabo', '2026-09-10T15:18:12.614Z');
INSERT INTO exercises (id, wger_id, language, name, description, category, muscles, muscles_secondary, equipment, image_url, license, license_author, source_url, search_blob, updated_at) VALUES ('66a42396-c207-44da-bc75-758a89d32404', 371, 'en', 'Leg Press', 'The leg press is a weight training exercise in which the individual pushes a weight or resistance away from them using their legs.', 'pernas', '["posteriores de coxa","panturrilhas","glúteos","quadríceps"]', '[]', '[]', 'https://wger.de/media/exercise-images/371/d2136f96-3a43-4d4c-9944-1919c4ca1ce1.webp', 'CC0', 'BFad07', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/371/view/', 'leg press posteriores de coxa panturrilhas gluteos quadriceps', '2026-09-10T15:18:12.614Z');
INSERT INTO exercises (id, wger_id, language, name, description, category, muscles, muscles_secondary, equipment, image_url, license, license_author, source_url, search_blob, updated_at) VALUES ('0cc9c8ed-57f1-42c3-a4c4-6e57e6a1b878', 1515, 'en', 'Leg Press Toe Press', 'Move the leg press using your calves by placing your feet at the bottom of the platform.', 'pernas', '["panturrilhas"]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 'CC-BY-SA 4', 'Expenses7000', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/1515/view/', 'leg press toe press panturrilhas', '2026-09-10T15:18:12.614Z');
INSERT INTO exercises (id, wger_id, language, name, description, category, muscles, muscles_secondary, equipment, image_url, license, license_author, source_url, search_blob, updated_at) VALUES ('5f0b757c-0d6a-430b-9d5e-3bfba202878e', 373, 'en', 'Leg Presses (narrow)', 'The exercise is very similar to the wide leg press:

 Sit on the machine and put your feet on the platform so far apart that you could just put another foot in between them. The feet are parallel and point up.

 Lower the weight so much, that the knees form a right angle. Push immediately the platform up again, without any pause. When in the lower position, the knees point a bit outwards and the movement should be always fluid.', 'pernas', '["quadríceps"]', '["glúteos"]', '[]', 'https://wger.de/media/exercise-images/373/60e2aa21-1910-40d3-9fed-babfee06dd48.png', 'CC-BY-SA 3', 'wger.de', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/373/view/', 'leg presses (narrow) quadriceps gluteos', '2026-09-10T15:18:12.614Z');
INSERT INTO exercises (id, wger_id, language, name, description, category, muscles, muscles_secondary, equipment, image_url, license, license_author, source_url, search_blob, updated_at) VALUES ('661287d4-d1dc-485c-896b-73f90b000536', 374, 'en', 'Leg Presses (wide)', 'Sit on the machine and put your feet on the platform, a bit more than shoulder wide. The feet are turned outwards by a few degrees.

 Lower the weight so much, that the knees form a right angle. Push immediately the platform up again, without any pause. When in the lower position, the knees point a bit outwards and the movement should be always fluid.', 'pernas', '["quadríceps"]', '["glúteos"]', '[]', NULL, 'CC-BY-SA 3', 'wger.de', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/374/view/', 'leg presses (wide) quadriceps gluteos', '2026-09-10T15:18:12.614Z');
INSERT INTO exercises (id, wger_id, language, name, description, category, muscles, muscles_secondary, equipment, image_url, license, license_author, source_url, search_blob, updated_at) VALUES ('b2025776-2397-4de7-a49e-296321169481', 979, 'en', 'Leg raises pull up bar', 'with a firm grip with both hands on the bar, raise your outstretched legs, until you reach a 90° angle with your torso.', 'core', '["abdômen"]', '["oblíquos","quadríceps"]', '["Barra fixa"]', 'https://wger.de/media/exercise-images/979/27097a3a-5749-428d-b94c-6082afe390f6.png', 'CC-BY-SA 4', 'clafal', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/979/view/', 'leg raises pull up bar abdomen obliquos quadriceps barra fixa', '2026-09-10T15:18:12.614Z');
INSERT INTO exercises (id, wger_id, language, name, description, category, muscles, muscles_secondary, equipment, image_url, license, license_author, source_url, search_blob, updated_at) VALUES ('9e34bc01-9cec-4ee2-a9bb-9c937a471c24', 377, 'en', 'Leg Raises, Lying', 'Lay down on a bench and hold onto the recliner with your hands to keep you stable. Hold your legs straight and lift them till they make an angle of about 45°. Make a short pause of 1 sec. and go slowly down to the initial position. To increase the intensity you can make a longer pause of 7 sec. every 5th time.', 'core', '["abdômen"]', '["serrátil"]', '["Colchonete"]', 'https://wger.de/media/exercise-images/125/Leg-raises-2.png', 'CC-BY-SA 3', 'wger.de', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/377/view/', 'leg raises, lying abdomen serratil colchonete', '2026-09-10T15:18:12.614Z');
INSERT INTO exercises (id, wger_id, language, name, description, category, muscles, muscles_secondary, equipment, image_url, license, license_author, source_url, search_blob, updated_at) VALUES ('5f514f9e-6bd9-408e-85b2-c25eb04af33b', 378, 'en', 'Leg Raises, Standing', 'Put your forearms on the pads on the leg raise machine, the body is hanging freely. Lift now your legs with a fast movement as high as you can, make a short pause of 1sec at the top, and bring them down again. Make sure that during the exercise your body does not swing, only the legs should move.', 'core', '["abdômen"]', '["serrátil"]', '[]', NULL, 'CC-BY-SA 3', 'wger.de', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/378/view/', 'leg raises, standing abdomen serratil', '2026-09-10T15:18:12.614Z');
INSERT INTO exercises (id, wger_id, language, name, description, category, muscles, muscles_secondary, equipment, image_url, license, license_author, source_url, search_blob, updated_at) VALUES ('19d10f51-3e53-4d8f-b283-1d8d9a7d3543', 1909, 'en', 'Leg Wheel', 'Lay on the back and lift legs in perpendicular fashion, keeping the knees together.

 Start making small circles in one direction with both of your knees with very small range of motion, focusing on abs and keeping your back in contact with the floor.', 'core', '["abdômen"]', '[]', '["Peso corporal"]', NULL, 'CC-BY-SA 4', 'cybro', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/1909/view/', 'leg wheel abdomen peso corporal', '2026-09-10T15:18:12.614Z');
INSERT INTO exercises (id, wger_id, language, name, description, category, muscles, muscles_secondary, equipment, image_url, license, license_author, source_url, search_blob, updated_at) VALUES ('2e96e572-ddb4-4251-a812-ccf03ea677a6', 1918, 'en', 'Legend Chest Press', 'Plate-loaded chest press machine from Legend Fitness LeverEdge line.', 'peito', '["peito"]', '["ombros","tríceps"]', '[]', NULL, 'CC-BY-SA 4', '', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/1918/view/', 'legend chest press peito ombros triceps', '2026-09-10T15:18:12.614Z');
